---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="WoW Forever Talent Calculator Changelog & Data Updates"
  description="Every data update to the WoW Forever talent calculator. Now on beta build 70291 from October 8, 2026, with all talent changes listed by class."
  dateModified="2026-10-15"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Changelog', url: '/changelog/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      We update the calculator when a new WoW Forever beta build changes
      talents. Talent data comes from
      <a href="https://talentsforever.com/" rel="external">talentsforever.com</a>
      (CC BY 4.0), which reads the beta game files.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="build-70291">
    <h2 id="build-70291">October 15, 2026 — Beta build 70291</h2>
    <p>
      The calculator now uses beta build 70291 (October 8, 2026), including
      the Warrior hotfixes of October 1–2. Saved builds and share links still
      open. Points on removed talents are refunded.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Warrior:</strong> Fury gains Lingering Rage, Furious Precision
        and Gore Drinker. Improved Cleave, Boundless Rage and Precision are
        removed. Protection loses Toughness and Vitality; Iron Will moves to
        row 1. Focused Rage moves from row 6 to row 5; Bastion stays in row
        6. Impale now requires Deep Wounds.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Druid:</strong> Mangle is now Primal Bite and Primal Fury is
        Blood Frenzy. Feral loses King of the Jungle and gains Shifting Power
        and Improved Shifting Power. Predatory Instincts is now Natural
        Instinct.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Druid:</strong> Balance of Nature is removed.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Paladin:</strong> Improved Holy Strike and Crusade are
        removed. Holy Strike has a 10-second cooldown. Holy Shield now
        increases chance to block by 30% (was 20%) and deals 110 Holy damage
        per block (was 65).
      </li>
      <li><strong>Rogue:</strong> Restless Blades is removed.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Priest:</strong> Penance rank 4 deals 92 damage (was 131) and
        heals 425 (was 673).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Mage:</strong> Hot Streak is now Heating Up.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Warlock:</strong> Soul Harvesting is now Soul Harvest.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Warlock:</strong> Drain Hope is removed.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Shaman:</strong> Elemental Alacrity moves from row 6 to row 3
        and no longer has a prerequisite. Elemental Fury moves to row 6.
        Water Shield has no cooldown.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hunter:</strong> Lightning Reflexes is 2% per rank.
        Resourcefulness is 30%/60%. Deflection is 1% per rank. Expose Prey
        lasts 10 seconds. Sniper Shot reaches 45 yards.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="launch">
    <h2 id="launch">September 17, 2026 — Launch</h2>
    <p>
      First release with all classes, based on BlizzCon 2026 data (September
      15, 2026).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-label="Related pages">
    <p>
      <a href="/">Calculator →</a> ·
      <a href="/wow-forever-beta-end/">Beta end &amp; launch dates →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
